		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "69095bf1-2425-4a42-8e2b-2e25720662c3")
		(at 9 16)
		(descr "Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero flat-mount, PERIMETER ONLY (no rear cluster pads). Geometry from the Waveshare dimension drawing: 18.00x23.50mm body, castellations 1.38mm from each long edge (15.24mm row spacing), 2.54mm pitch, first pad 1.59mm from the USB-C end. Pads 1-9 left (5V GND 3V3 GP1-GP6), 18-26 right (TX RX GP13-GP7); numbering matches the full FlatMount so the same symbol applies, with 10-17 left as no-connects. The 8 rear pads are DELETED, not corrected -- scout nets none of them. Do not use for buddy, which needs the clustered variant measured.")
